<title>USA: TABLE - Michael Foods Inc Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Michael Foods Inc Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						June 30,     June 30,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    $237,861 $151,678 $433,279 $295,550</p>
<p> Cost of sales		 198,400  133,480  370,089  258,439</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative		22,176   10,917   36,845   22,442</p>
<p> Operating profit	     17,285    7,281   26,345   14,669</p>
<p> Interest expense, net	 3,003    1,824    5,281    3,744</p>
<p> Net earnings		    8,352    3,277   12,314    6,555</p>
<p> Earnings per share		.39     0.17	.60     0.34</p>
<p> Weighted average shares    21,258   19,389   20,674   19,371</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for 1997 reflect February 26, 1997, acquisition of Papetti's Hygrade Egg Products Inc and affiliated companies.  Operating results include losses from the frozen French fry business of approximately $0.05 a share in the first half of 1997 and $0.07 per share in the first half 1996.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 results reflect one-time severance expenses and other costs of about $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
